sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server

    Note right of browser: After user opened the webpage, the user typed a new note and clicked on save. Prompting a re-request of the webpage

    browser->>server: POST https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/new_note
    activate server
    server-->>browser: HTML document
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: Thus the browser re-requests the necessary files again

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.css
    activate server
    server-->>browser: the css file
    deactivate server

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.js
    activate server
    server-->>browser: the JavaScript file
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: The browser starts executing the JavaScript code that fetches the JSON from the server again

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/data.json
    activate server
    server-->>browser: [{ "content": "ohhhhhh", "date": "2026-07-26T14:49:09.444Z" }, ... ]
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: The browser executes the callback function that renders the notes